@startuml deployers
title Deployers
hide empty members

class JsonRegistry << (S, motivation) >>
class CreateXScript << (S, motivation) >>

class BaseDeployer << (S, motivation) >>
class GatedDeployer << (S, motivation) >>

class DeployGateDeployer << (S, application) >>
class DeployAdapters << (S, application) >>
class PoolHooks << (S, application) >>
class DeployOnchainPMV2 << (S, application) >>

class FullDeployer  << (S, application) >> {
    + function deployFull()
}
class LaunchDeployer  << (S, application) >> {
    + function run()
}

class DeployGate << (C, implementation) >>
class CoreActionBatcher << (C, implementation) >>
class NonCoreActionBatcher << (C, implementation) >>
class AdapterActionBatcher << (C, implementation) >>

class DeployerInput << (S,strategy) JsonConfig >>

enum DeployPhase {
    Validate
    Execute
}

BaseDeployer -up-|> JsonRegistry
BaseDeployer -up-|> CreateXScript

GatedDeployer --up-|> BaseDeployer
FullDeployer -up-|> GatedDeployer
LaunchDeployer -up-|> FullDeployer

DeployGateDeployer ---up-|> BaseDeployer
DeployAdapters ---up-|> BaseDeployer
PoolHooks ---up-|> BaseDeployer
DeployOnchainPMV2 ---up-|> BaseDeployer

GatedDeployer -right> DeployPhase
FullDeployer -left> DeployerInput

DeployGateDeployer ..> DeployGate
FullDeployer ...> CoreActionBatcher
FullDeployer ...> NonCoreActionBatcher
FullDeployer ...> AdapterActionBatcher

note right of FullDeployer: Used in integration tests and \ntestnets
note right of LaunchDeployer: Loads network config from JSON;\nentry point for production deployments
note right of DeployOnchainPMV2: Standalone script for deploying\nOnchainPM to existing environments
note right of DeployGateDeployer: Brings up the DeployGate once per chain;\nprerequisite of both gated phases

@enduml
